  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for implementing the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities (CRPD) in the Commonwealth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Commonwealth Disabled People&apos;s Forum&apos;s (CDPF) work across the Commonwealth. This includes the development and implementation of regional disability inclusion training courses, training and advocacy support to disabled people&apos;s organisations (OPDs), and regional research helpdesks. The funding is managed by ADD International.</narrative>
  </description>
